WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.280
An import can run fine today and still
make it harder to keep layers separate.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.937
This repository has a rule for its core.

3
00:00:09.937 --> 00:00:14.693
The architecture scan finds the core
importing from the command line layer,

4
00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:17.800
which reverses the direction
the project expects.

5
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.371
Write down the boundaries
you want to keep.

6
00:00:29.371 --> 00:00:32.480
The report gives you a file
and a rule to work from.
